scan                       read the camera, then sync with the backend
camlist                    list the media on the camera
upload                     sync stored data with the backend only
update                     sync, then look for a firmware update now
stop                       end the running scan
photo                      take a photo, then read the camera
video start|stop           start or stop a video on the camera
delete <mediaId>           delete one recording (asks for a code)
format                     erase the camera's SD card (asks for a code)
actions                    queued camera actions and results
restart                    restart the hub (like the reset button)
ping                       keep the hub awake a while longer
heap [blocks]              internal RAM by capability and region
ls [path]                  list a directory of the SD card
cat <path> [offset [len]]  send a file as Base64 lines
rm [-r] <path>             delete a file or a directory tree
sdbench [total_kb [chunk]] SD card write throughput
config show                list settings (secrets hidden)
config set <key> <value>   store a setting
config set-hex <key> <hex> store a hex-encoded setting
config unset <key>         erase a setting
config clear               erase all settings
keys: wifi_ssid wifi_password api_url device_key camera_plan
      checkin_min transport apn sim_pin power direction
      destination webdav_url webdav_user webdav_password
      webdav_videos telegram_token telegram_chat health_url
      web_password camera_user camera_password
